                "label": "Configuration vs. Waveform",
                "sequence": "0",
                "user_properties": [
                    [
                        "rdfs:comment",
                        "Many SDR SoCs/platforms have well-defined register interfaces\nfor the RF front-end and separate logic/processing for the waveform, \nmaking independent modification straightforward. \n\n\nExamples: Xilinx RFSoC, AD9361"
                    ]
                ]
            },
